  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "p00000",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 1,
      "text_preview": "後漢安息國三藏安世高譯",
      "char_count": 11,
      "section_type": "译者署名",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00001",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 2,
      "text_preview": "為佛弟子，常於晝夜，至心誦念，八大人覺：",
      "char_count": 20,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00002",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 3,
      "text_preview": "第一覺悟：世間無常，國土危脆；四大苦空，五陰無我；生滅變異，虛偽無主；心是惡源，形為罪藪。如是觀察，漸離生死。",
      "char_count": 55,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00003",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 4,
      "text_preview": "第二覺知：多欲為苦，生死疲勞，從貪欲起；少欲無為，身心自在。",
      "char_count": 30,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00004",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 5,
      "text_preview": "第三覺知：心無厭足，唯得多求，增長罪惡；菩薩不爾，常念知足，安貧守道，唯慧是業。",
      "char_count": 40,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00005",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 6,
      "text_preview": "第四覺知：懈怠墜落；常行精進，破煩惱惡，摧伏四魔，出陰界獄。",
      "char_count": 30,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00006",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 7,
      "text_preview": "第五覺悟：愚癡生死。菩薩常念，廣學多聞，增長智慧，成就辯才，教化一切，悉以大樂。",
      "char_count": 40,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00007",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 8,
      "text_preview": "第六覺知：貧苦多怨，橫結惡緣。菩薩布施，等念冤親，不念舊惡，不憎惡人。",
      "char_count": 35,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00008",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 9,
      "text_preview": "第七覺悟：五欲過患。雖為俗人，不染世樂；常念三衣，瓦鉢法器；志願出家，守道清白；梵行高遠，慈悲一切。",
      "char_count": 50,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00009",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 10,
      "text_preview": "第八覺知：生死熾然，苦惱無量。發大乘心，普濟一切；願代眾生，受無量苦；令諸眾生，畢竟大樂。",
      "char_count": 45,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00010",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 11,
      "text_preview": "如此八事，乃是諸佛菩薩大人之所覺悟。精進行道，慈悲修慧，乘法身船，至涅槃岸；復還生死，度脫眾生。以前八事，開導一切，令諸眾生，覺生死苦，捨離五欲，修心聖道。",
      "char_count": 78,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": [
        "c008",
        "c010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00011",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 12,
      "text_preview": "若佛弟子，誦此八事，於念念中，滅無量罪；進趣菩提，速登正覺；永斷生死，常住快樂。",
      "char_count": 40,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    }
  ],
